{"ticker":"LRCX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:15Z","profile":{"longName":"Lam Research Corporation","shortName":"Lam Research Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"United States","website":"https://www.lamresearch.com","fullTimeEmployees":24300,"marketCap":299228069888,"trailingPE":35.634872,"forwardPE":19.540989,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":11.452419,"pegRatio":1.11,"targetMeanPrice":364.03333,"targetHighPrice":500.0,"targetLowPrice":255.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":30,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.544,"earningsGrowth":0.766,"grossMargins":0.51054,"operatingMargins":0.39951,"profitMargins":0.3234,"totalRevenue":26127935488,"beta":1.854,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":438.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":135.5,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.52},"summary":"Lam Research Corporation designs, manufactures, markets, refurbishes, and services semiconductor processing equipment used in the fabrication of integrated circuits in the United States, China, Korea, Taiwan, Japan, Southeast Asia, and Europe. The company offers ALTUS systems to deposit conformal or selective films for tungsten or molybdenum metallization applications; SABRE electrochemical deposition products for copper interconnect transition, which support copper damascene manufacturing; Striker single-wafer atomic layer deposition products for dielectric film solutions; and VECTOR plasma-enhanced chemical vapor deposition (CVD) products. It also provides Akara, a conductor etch system designed to enhance etch precision, selectivity, and defect control; Argos, Prevos, and Selis, which are selective etch systems used in the fabrication of advanced logic and memory devices that require precise control at nanoscale dimensions; Flex for dielectric etch applications; Vantex, a dielectric etch system that provides RF technology and repeatable wafer-to-wafer performance enabled by Equipment Intelligence solutions; Kiyo for conductor etch applications; Syndion for deep silicon etch; and Versys metal products for metal etch processes. In addition, the company offers Coronus bevel clean products to enhance die yield and Da Vinci, DV-Prime, EOS, and SP series products to address variou","summary_zh":"Lam Research Corporation 設計、製造、銷售、翻新和服務用於美國、中國、韓國、台灣、日本、東南亞和歐洲積體電路製造的半導體加工設備。該公司提供 ALTUS 系統，用於沉積用於鎢或鉬金屬化應用的保形或選擇性薄膜；用於銅互連過渡的 SABRE 電化學沉積產品，支持銅鑲嵌製造；用於介電薄膜解決方案的 Striker 單晶圓原子層沉積產品；和 VECTOR 等離子增強化學氣相沉積 (CVD) 產品。它還提供 Akara，一種導體蝕刻系統，旨在提高蝕刻精度、選擇性和缺陷控制； Argos、Prevos 和 Selis，這些是選擇性蝕刻系統，旨在提高蝕刻精度、選擇性和缺陷控制； Argos、Prevos 和 Selis，這些是選擇性蝕刻系統，用於製造需要奈米級尺寸精確控制的先進邏輯和存儲器件；適用於電介質蝕刻應用的 Flex； Vantex，一種介電蝕刻系統，透過設備智能設計解決方案提供重複使用的 Flex； Syndion；以及用於金屬蝕刻製程的 Versys 金屬產品。此外，該公司還提供 Coronus 斜角清潔產品來提高晶片良率，並提供 Da Vinci、DV-Prime、EOS 和 SP 系列產品來解決各種問題。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體設備與材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":95.77,"h":97.27,"l":94.11,"c":97.03,"v":14695200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":97.03,"h":97.86,"l":96.44,"c":97.74,"v":11023300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":97.66,"h":101.11,"l":97.16,"c":100.42,"v":8822400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":101.7,"h":103.01,"l":100.68,"c":102.95,"v":8142000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":105.01,"h":106.37,"l":104.48,"c":105.07,"v":7972700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":104.91,"h":105.82,"l":104.46,"c":105.57,"v":7264300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":106.7,"h":107.78,"l":104.61,"c":107.36,"v":12279400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":108.35,"h":115.9,"l":108.29,"c":115.58,"v":20296100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":115.92,"h":117.5,"l":115.88,"c":116.96,"v":11060500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":117.8,"h":119.33,"l":117.03,"c":119.21,"v":9785700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":119.98,"h":120.97,"l":118.67,"c":120.47,"v":9897200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":120.82,"h":123.28,"l":119.51,"c":121.9,"v":10996100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":126.55,"h":128.7,"l":125.04,"c":126.32,"v":13763900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":126.36,"h":127.8,"l":125.0,"c":126.92,"v":24271900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":129.8,"h":132.63,"l":129.16,"c":132.2,"v":13403700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":129.75,"h":