DVTc3laTV9UWUFaWXpNcjctMmk0UThRTDBLTmd2ZlJZU0k0cGhoVHVOQ1duTE5LSVVOZ0JweE0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Lam Research、Lockheed Martin 和 Equinor 的頂級分析師報告"},{"title":"Is Lam Research (LRCX) Cheap On Strong Earnings And AI Demand Guidance?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Lam Research (LRCX) 因強勁獲利和人工智慧需求指引而便宜嗎？"},{"title":"Lam Research stock trades 2.17% above prior Xetra close - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNMVpWZl9jUjlWS3VwbGdBR3d0eWtKTUhYRDBna0hQaG11bEJXdFZIZXZvbjVHVGdyNEdIem9VZ3NiN3FlNDQxLUlKWk11MHZ5a0QtQTJCZlNaRlBIbVBYRXBjSXJoeHRMOWtBVlY1RTNmcjUyYVFsenhsWGI2WUhYd1ZOV0k5eGo5dkZDWkl6QjgzeW5QUGpJQmYxbHhsQlFwdkRtcmNNNTU1MWJPcTBiX2ZzbWJHd2RH?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Lam Research 股票交易價格比 Xetra 前收盤價高出 2.17% - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"What Lam Research Stock Earnings Guidance Means For Shareholders","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Lam Research 股票獲利指引對股東意味著什麼"},{"title":"Lam Research reports 54.4 percent revenue growth for Lam Research stock - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Lam Research 報告 Lam Research 股票收入成長 54.4% - ad-hoc-news.de"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-07","period":"2026-06-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/707549/000070754926000037/lrcx-20260628.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Incorporated in 1980, Lam Research Corporation (\"Lam Research,\" \"Lam,\" \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" or the \"Company\") is a Delaware corporation, headquartered in Fremont, California. We maintain a network of facilities throughout Asia, Europe, and the United States in order to meet the needs of our dynamic customer base.","zh":"Lam Research Corporation（「Lam Research」、「Lam」、「我們」、「我們的」或「公司」）成立於 1980 年，是一家特拉華州公司，總部位於加州弗里蒙特。我們在亞洲、歐洲和美國設有設施網路，以滿足動態客戶群的需求。"},{"en":"Our Annual Report on Form 10-K, Quarterly Reports on Forms 10-Q, Current Reports on Forms 8-K, Proxy Statements and all other filings we make with the SEC are available on our website, free of charge, as soon as reasonably practical after we file them with or furnish them to the SEC and are also available online at the SEC's website at www.sec.gov.","zh":"我們向 SEC 提交的 10-K 表格年度報告、10-Q 表格季度報告、8-K 表格當前報告、委託書以及我們向 SEC 提交的所有其他文件均可在我們向 SEC 提交或提供給 SEC 後儘快在我們的網站上免費獲取，也可在 SEC 網站 www.sec.gov 上在線獲取。"},{"en":"The Lam Research logo, Lam Research, and all product and service names used in this report are either registered trademarks or trademarks of Lam Research Corporation or its subsidiaries in the United States and/or other countries. All other marks mentioned herein are the property of their respective holders.","zh":"Lam Research 標誌、Lam Research 以及本報告中使用的所有產品和服務名稱均為 Lam Research Corporation 或其子公司在美國和/或其他國家的註冊商標或商標。本文提及的所有其他標誌均為其各自所有者的財產。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Deposition processes create layers of dielectric (insulating) and metal (conducting) materials used to build a semiconductor device. Depending on the type of material and structure being made, different techniques are employed. Electrochemical deposition creates the copper wiring (interconnect) that links devices in an integrated circuit (\"IC\" or \"chip\"). Plating of copper and other metals is also used for TSV and WLP applications. Tiny molybdenum or tungsten connectors and thin barriers are made with the precision of chemical vapor deposition and atomic layer deposition, which adds only a few layers of atoms at a time. Plasma-enhanced CVD, high-density plasma CVD, and ALD are used to form the critical insulating layers that isolate and protect all of these electrical structures. Lastly, post-deposition treatments such as ultraviolet thermal processing are used to improve dielectric film","zh":"沉積製程產生用於建造半導體裝置的介電（絕緣）和金屬（導電）材料層。根據所製造的材料和結構的類型，採用不同的技術。電化學沉積形成連接積體電路（“IC”或“晶片”）中的裝置的銅佈線（互連）。銅和其他金屬的電鍍也用於 TSV 和 WLP 應用。微小的鉬或鎢連接器和薄屏障是通過精確的化學氣相沉積和原子層沉積製成的，一次僅添加幾層原子。等離子體增強 CVD、高密度等離子體 CVD 和 ALD 用於形成隔離和保護所有這些電氣結構的關鍵絕緣層。最後，採用紫外線熱處理等沉積後處理來改善介電膜"},{"en":"Tungsten and/or molybdenum deposition is used to form conductive features such as contacts, vias, and wordlines on a chip. These features are small, often narrow, and use only a small amount of metal, so minimizing resistance and achieving complete fill can be difficult. At these nanoscale dimensions, even slight imperfections can impact device performance or cause a chip to fail. Our ALTUS systems combine CVD and ALD technologies to deposit the highly conformal or selective films as needed for advanced tungsten or molybdenum metallization (ALTUS Halo) applications in both logic and memory. The Multi-Station Sequential Deposition architecture enables nucleation layer formation and bulk CVD/ALD fill to be performed in the same chamber (\"in situ\"). Our ALD technologies are used in the metal deposition of barrier films to achieve high step coverage with precise composition control relative ","zh":"鎢和/或鉬沉積用於在晶片上形成導電特徵，例如觸點、通孔和字線。這些特徵很小，通常很窄，並且僅使用少量金屬，因此最小化電阻並實現完全填充可能很困難。在這些奈米級尺寸下，即使是輕微的缺陷也會影響設備性能或導致晶片故障。我們的 ALTUS 系統結合了 CVD 和 ALD 技術，可根據邏輯和記憶體中先進鎢或鉬金屬化 (ALTUS Halo) 應用的需要沉積高度保形或選擇性薄膜。多站順序沉積架構使得成核層形成和本體 CVD/ALD 填充能夠在同一室中（「原位」）進行。我們的 ALD 技術用於阻擋膜的金屬沉積，以實現高階梯覆蓋和相對精確的成分控制"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our customers include many of the world's leading semiconductor manufacturers. Customers continue to establish joint ventures, alliances, and licensing arrangements which have the potential to positively or negatively impact our competitive position and market opportunities. Refer to Note 9 of our Consolidated Financial Statements, included in Part II, Item 8 of this report, for information concerning customer concentrations. Our most significant customers during the fiscal years ending June 28, 2026, June 29, 2025, and June 30, 2024 included Micron Technology, Inc., Samsung Electronics Company, Ltd., SK hynix Inc., and Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company.","zh":"我們的客戶包括許多世界領先的半導體製造商。客戶繼續建立合資企業、聯盟和許可安排，這可能對我們的競爭地位和市場機會產生積極或消極的影響。有關客戶集中度的資訊，請參閱本報告第二部分第 8 項中的合併財務報表附註 9。截至2026年6月28日、2025年6月29日及2024年6月30日的財年，我們最重要的客戶包括美光科技公司、三星電子有限公司、SK海力士公司和台積電。"},{"en":"A material reduction in orders from our customers could adversely affect our results of operations and projected financial condition. Our business depends upon the expenditures of semiconductor manufacturers. Semiconductor manufacturers' businesses, in turn, depend on many factors, including their economic capability, the current and anticipated market demand for ICs, and the availability of equipment capacity to support that demand.","zh":"客戶訂單的大幅減少可能會對我們的經營業績和預期財務狀況產生不利影響。我們的業務取決於半導體製造商的支出。反過來，半導體製造商的業務取決於許多因素，包括其經濟能力、當前和預期的 IC 市場需求以及支援該需求的設備產能的可用性。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The semiconductor capital equipment industry is characterized by rapid change and is highly competitive throughout the world. To compete effectively, we invest significant financial resources targeted to strengthen and enhance our product and services portfolio and to maintain customer service and support locations globally. Semiconductor manufacturers evaluate capital equipment suppliers in many areas, including but not limited to process performance, productivity, defect control, customer support, and overall cost of ownership, which can be affected by many factors such as equipment design, reliability, software advancements, and similar factors. Our ability to succeed in the marketplace depends upon our ability to manufacture and ship products on a timeline that meets our customers' needs, maintain existing products, and introduce product enhancements and new products that meet custom","zh":"半導體資本設備產業具有快速變化的特點，在全球範圍內競爭激烈。為了有效競爭，我們投入大量財務資源，旨在加強和提高我們的產品和服務組合，並維持全球客戶服務和支援地點。半導體製造商在許多方面評估資本設備供應商，包括但不限於製程性能、生產率、缺陷控制、客戶支援和整體擁有成本，這些可能受到設備設計、可靠性、軟體進步和類似因素等許多因素的影響。我們在市場上取得成功的能力取決於我們在滿足客戶需求的時間內製造和運輸產品、維護現有產品以及推出產品增強功能和滿足客戶需求的新產品的能力"},{"en":"must also continue to meet the expectations of our installed base of customers through the delivery of high-quality and cost-efficient spare parts in the presence of competition from third-party spare parts providers.","zh":"在面臨來自第三方備件供應商的競爭的情況下，我們還必須透過提供高品質和具成本效益的備件來繼續滿足我們客戶群的期望。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-06-28","items":[{"name":"System","val":14885488000,"zh":"系統"},{"name":"Customer Supportand Other","val":8347202000,"zh":"客戶支援及其他"}],"total":23232690000},"geo":{"end":"2026-06-28","items":[{"name":"CN","val":7859811000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"TW","val":5222915000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"KR","val":4505327000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"JP","val":2171088000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"US","val":1528912000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"South East Asia","val":1245931000,"zh":"東南亞"},{"name":"Europe","val":698706000,"zh":"歐洲"}],"total":23232690000}},"peers":["KLAC","AMAT","ASML","AVGO","MRVL"]}}